th_10y":[5.4,4.9,4.4,4,3.8,3.5,3.2,2.9,2.6,2.2],"g1":5.4,"g2":3.5,"g":2.25,"wacc":4.74,"ev":436076.9,"fmp_official_ev":436076.9,"dcf_model_ev":410947.7,"ev_to_ebitda":9,"debt_to_ebitda":5.55,"net_debt_to_ebitda":4.25,"f_score":5,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 4.7%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $8,768M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 62.8%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.17"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":173.64,"default_fair_val":173.64,"premium_pct":12.2,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":7.9,"pe_forward":7,"pb_trailing":1,"pb_forward":0.9,"div_yield":3.42,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":2.01,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":62.8,"cash_to_assets":10.1,"current_ratio":1.17,"roe":12.9,"roa":4.7,"moat":{"ticker":"TM","period":"2027Q1","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"豐田的品牌價值在全球汽車市場中具有顯著的定價權。其「品質、耐用、可靠」的品牌形象深入人心，使得消費者願意為其產品支付溢價，尤其是在二手市場上，豐田車輛的保值率也相對較高。儘管面臨電動化轉型挑戰，但其傳統燃油車和混合動力車型的強勁品牌力仍是重要的護城河。","comment_en":"Toyota possesses significant pricing power in the global automotive market, built upon its strong brand reputation for quality, durability, and reliability. This allows consumers to pay a premium for its vehicles, and contributes to strong resale values. While facing the transition to electrification, its established brand strength in traditional internal combustion engine and hybrid vehicles remains a key moat."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"豐田在汽車技術，特別是混合動力技術（如 THS 系統）方面擁有大量專利，這在過去構成了顯著的技術壁壘。雖然專利會過期，但其長期的研發投入和技術積累，使其在相關領域仍保持領先地位。在電動化和自動駕駛領域，豐田也在積極佈局專利，以應對未來的競爭格局。","comment_en":"Toyota holds a substantial portfolio of patents, particularly in hybrid technology (e.g., THS system), which historically provided a significant technological barrier. While patents expire, its long-term R&D investment and accumulated expertise keep it at the forefront. The company is actively pursuing patents in electrification and autonomous driving to secure its future competitive position."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"汽車產業的轉換成本相對較高，主要體現在車輛的價格、貸款協議、保險以及車主對特定車型的熟悉度。對於豐田車主而言，更換到其他品牌的汽車需要重新適應操作、維修體系和品牌偏好。然而，隨著汽車技術的同質化和消費者對新技術的接受度提高，轉換成本的絕對優勢正在減弱。","comment_en":"Switching costs in the automotive industry are moderately high, primarily due to vehicle price, financing, insurance, and owner familiarity with specific models. Toyota owners face the hassle of adapting to new controls, service networks, and brand preferences when switching. However, increasing technological standardization and consumer openness to new technologies are gradually diminishing the absolute advantage of these switching costs."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"汽車產業的網絡效應相對較弱。雖然龐大的經銷商和維修網絡能提供便利性，但這更多是規模優勢而非真正的網絡效應，即用戶越多，產品價值越高的情況。豐田的經銷商網絡是其優勢，但並未形成像社交媒體或平台經濟那樣的自我強化循環。","comment_en":"Network effects are relatively weak in the automotive industry. While Toyota's extensive dealer and service network offers convenience, this is more a function of scale than true network effects where value increases with user base. The dealership network is an advantage, but it doesn't create a self-reinforcing loop like those seen in social media or platform economies."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"豐田是全球最大的汽車製造商之一，其規模經濟效應極為顯著。龐大的生產規模、全球化的供應鏈管理、精益生產（TPS）以及持續的製造成本優化，使其在採購、生產和分銷環節擁有巨大的成本優勢。這不僅體現在其產品的價格競爭力上，也支撐了其穩定的盈利能力。","comment_en":"As one of the world's largest automakers, Toyota benefits immensely from economies of scale. Its massive production volume, global supply chain management, the Toyota Production System (TPS), and continuous manufacturing cost optimization provide substantial cost advantages in procurement, production, and distribution. This translates into competitive pricing and supports its consistent profitability."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"豐田在全球主要汽車市場都擁有廣泛的生產基地和銷售網絡，這使其能夠更好地適應各地區的市場需求和法規。然而，這種地理佈局並非獨一無二，許多大型汽車製造商也採取了類似的全球化戰略。其在日本本土市場的強勢地位可以視為一種地理優勢，但整體而言，其地理資產的獨特性不高。","comment_en":"Toyota has an extensive network of production facilities and sales operations in major global markets, allowing it to cater effectively to regional demands and regulations. However, this geographic footprint is not unique, as many large automakers employ similar global strategies. Its strong position in the Japanese domestic market can be considered a geographic advantage, but overall, the uniqueness of its geographic assets is moderate."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"豐田生產體系（TPS）是業界公認的運營效率標竿，以其精益求精、持續改善（Kaizen）和消除浪費的理念聞名。這種卓越的運營效率不僅降低了生產成本，還提高了產品質量和生產靈活性，使其能夠快速響應市場變化，並在行業內保持領先的盈利能力。","comment_en":"The Toyota Production System (TPS) is globally recognized as a benchmark for operational efficiency, renowned for its principles of continuous improvement (Kaizen) and waste elimination. This operational excellence not only reduces production costs but also enhances product quality and manufacturing flexibility, enabling rapid responses to market changes and maintaining industry-leading profitability."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"豐田過往的資本配置策略相對穩健，注重維持強勁的資產負債表，並在研發、產能擴張和股東回報之間取得平衡。儘管近年來在電動化轉型上投入巨大，但其現金儲備和盈利能力使其有能力應對這些投資。管理層在傳統業務和新興技術之間進行權衡的能力是其資本配置的關鍵。","comment_en":"Toyota's historical capital allocation strategy has been prudent, focusing on maintaining a strong balance sheet and balancing investments in R&D, capacity expansion, and shareholder returns. Despite significant recent investments in electrification, its cash reserves and profitability enable it to manage these expenditures. Management's ability to balance traditional business needs with emerging technology investments is key to its capital allocation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"豐田憑藉其產品的可靠性和耐用性，以及完善的售後服務網絡，培養了高度的客戶忠誠度。許多車主在體驗過豐田車輛的長期價值後，傾向於再次購買豐田品牌。雖然電動化趨勢可能帶來新的競爭者和客戶群體，但豐田現有的客戶基礎仍然是一個重要的穩定因素。","comment_en":"Toyota cultivates high customer loyalty through the reliability and durability of its products, coupled with an extensive after-sales service network. Many owners, having experienced the long-term value of Toyota vehicles, tend to repurchase the brand. While the shift towards electrification may introduce new competitors and customer segments, Toyota's existing customer base remains a significant stabilizing factor."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"豐田的產品以其卓越的耐用性和長壽命而聞名，這構成了其核心競爭力。這種耐用性不僅降低了車主的總體擁有成本，也增強了品牌聲譽。在汽車產業面臨快速技術變革的背景下，豐田對核心品質的堅持，使其產品在長時間內仍能保持市場競爭力，並不易被顛覆。","comment_en":"Toyota vehicles are renowned for their exceptional durability and longevity, forming a core competitive advantage. This durability lowers the total cost of ownership for customers and enhances brand reputation. Amidst rapid technological change in the auto industry, Toyota's commitment to fundamental quality ensures its products remain competitive over extended periods, making them less susceptible to disruption."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"豐田汽車展現了強勁的經濟護城河，尤其體現在其規模經濟（M5）和卓越的運營效率（M7）上，這使其成為全球成本最低的汽車製造商之一。其品牌價值（M1）和產品耐用性（M10）也帶來了穩定的客戶忠誠度（M9）和一定的定價權。雖然在專利（M2）和轉換成本（M3）方面具有一定優勢，但網絡效應（M4）較弱，地理資產（M6）的獨特性也有限。豐田的護城河更偏向於一個高效運轉的「收費橋」模式，通過規模化生產和精益管理，持續為消費者提供高性價比的汽車，並從中獲取穩定的利潤。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Toyota Motor Corporation exhibits a robust economic moat, primarily driven by its significant economies of scale (M5) and exceptional operational efficiency (M7), positioning it among the world's lowest-cost automakers. Its strong brand reputation (M1) and product durability (M10) foster considerable customer loyalty (M9) and pricing power. While patents (M2) and switching costs (M3) offer some advantages, network effects (M4) are weak, and geographic assets (M6) lack unique distinction. Toyota's moat functions akin to an efficient 'toll bridge,' leveraging scaled production and lean management to consistently deliver value-conscious vehicles and generate stable profits.","evidenceHash":"aef684d7aa465a53a058b550793343ff139d3e358467a79b5dbc1f64ce99b0ac","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"JPY","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"9e0c7321451d36ac6dff88997c820e9f6da552e879b36165ffc66dc4940768f8"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"JPY","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"9e0c7321451d36ac6dff88997c820e9f6da552e879b36165ffc66dc4940768f8"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TM.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TM.png","website":"https://global.toyota","ceo":"Kenta Kon","full_time_employees":"390927","description":"Toyota Motor Corporation is a multinational automotive manufacturer responsible for the design, production, assembly, and sale of a diverse range of passenger vehicles, minivans, commercial vehicles, and their associated components and accessories. The company organizes its operations into distinct segments: Automotive, Financial Services, and various other ventures. Its extensive vehicle portfolio includes environmentally friendly options such as hybrid cars under the Prius brand and advanced fuel cell vehicles like the MIRAI. For conventional engine vehicles, it offers models like the subcompact and compact Corolla and Raize. Under the overarching Toyota brand, the company provides mini-vehicles, general passenger cars, commercial vehicles, and automotive parts. Its offerings also encompass mid-size and luxury automobiles, alongside sports cars such as the GR Yaris, Corolla Sport, Corolla Cross, and Supra, and recreational and sport-utility vehicles like the Highlander. Furthermore, Toyota produces pickup trucks, exemplified by the Tacoma, as well as minivans, heavy-duty trucks, and buses. Beyond vehicle manufacturing, Toyota provides a suite of financial services, including retail and wholesale financing, leasing arrangements, insurance products, and credit cards. It also diversifies into the prefabricated housing sector, handling its design, manufacturing, and sales. For automotive enthusiasts, the company operates GAZOO.com, an informational web portal. Established in 1933 and headquartered in Toyota, Japan, the company boasts a global presence, conducting business across Japan, North America, Europe, Asia, Central and South America, Oceania, Africa, and the Middle East.","description_en":"Toyota Motor Corporation is a multinational automotive manufacturer responsible for the design, production, assembly, and sale of a diverse range of passenger vehicles, minivans, commercial vehicles, and their associated components and accessories. The company organizes its operations into distinct segments: Automotive, Financial Services, and various other ventures. Its extensive vehicle portfolio includes environmentally friendly options such as hybrid cars under the Prius brand and advanced fuel cell vehicles like the MIRAI. For conventional engine vehicles, it offers models like the subcompact and compact Corolla and Raize. Under the overarching Toyota brand, the company provides mini-vehicles, general passenger cars, commercial vehicles, and automotive parts. Its offerings also encompass mid-size and luxury automobiles, alongside sports cars such as the GR Yaris, Corolla Sport, Corolla Cross, and Supra, and recreational and sport-utility vehicles like the Highlander. Furthermore, Toyota produces pickup trucks, exemplified by the Tacoma, as well as minivans, heavy-duty trucks, and buses. Beyond vehicle manufacturing, Toyota provides a suite of financial services, including retail and wholesale financing, leasing arrangements, insurance products, and credit cards. It also diversifies into the prefabricated housing sector, handling its design, manufacturing, and sales. For automotive enthusiasts, the company operates GAZOO.com, an informational web portal. Established in 1933 and headquartered in Toyota, Japan, the company boasts a global presence, conducting business across Japan, North America, Europe, Asia, Central and South America, Oceania, Africa, and the Middle East.","description_zh":"**豐田汽車公司 (Toyota Motor Corporation, TM)**\n\n豐田汽車公司為全球性汽車製造商，業務涵蓋各式乘用車、小貨車、商用車及其零組件與配件的設計、生產、組裝及銷售。公司營運劃分為汽車、金融服務及其他事業等主要板塊。\n\n其豐富的車款陣容包含環保車型，如Prius系列油電混合車，以及MIRAI氫燃料電池車。傳統燃油車方面，則提供Corolla、Raize等小型及緊湊型車款。豐田品牌旗下產品涵蓋微型車、一般乘用車、商用車及汽車零件。此外，亦提供Corolla Sport、Corolla Cross、Supra等運動跑車，以及Highlander等休旅車。卡車產品則有Tacoma皮卡，並生產小貨車、重型卡車及巴士。\n\n除了汽車製造，豐田亦提供零售與批發融資、租賃、保險及信用卡等金融服務。公司亦涉足預製房屋業務，負責設計、製造與銷售。為汽車愛好者，營運GAZOO.com資訊入口網站。豐田汽車創立於1933年，總部位於日本豐田市，業務遍及全球。","address":"1 Toyota-cho","city":"Toyota","state":"AI","zip":"471-8571","country":"JP","phone":"81 565 28 2121","full_address":"1 Toyota-cho, Toyota, AI 471-8571, JP","range_52w":"166.1-248.9","year_high":248.9,"year_low":166.1,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":166.1,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-29","name":"Ueda Tatsuro","title":"officer: Operating Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":109,"price":19.16,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-29","name":"Tomoyama Shigeki","title":"officer: Executive Fellow","is_buy":null,"action":"A-